[version]
1.4.1
[date]
2026-10-21
[whatsnew]
- BIG: All GUI apps now run in WINDOWS, not full-screen!
  - Each app gets its own window with title bar, close button, drag
  - Multiple apps can run simultaneously in separate windows
  - Click window to focus, click title bar to drag
  - Click X button to close
  - Apps share events via cooperative coroutine scheduling
- NEW: Monitor output support
  - Each window has an 'M' button in title bar
  - Click M to send that app's output to an attached Monitor block
  - Click M again to bring it back to the main screen
- NEW: monitor-cast command (usr/bin/monitor-cast.lua)
  - Cast text/images to any Monitor block
  - 'monitor-cast --list' to see attached monitors
  - 'monitor-cast <side> --text "Hello"'
  - 'monitor-cast <side> --file image.nfp'  (display NFP image)
  - 'monitor-cast <side> --clear'
  - Interactive mode without args (run commands on monitor)
- Window manager features:
  - 10 FPS window updates (0.1s timer)
  - Dead windows automatically removed
  - Drag windows by title bar
  - Z-order: clicking a window brings it to front
  - Monitor-cast creates a "shadow" window showing "[on monitor: side]"
- apps.conf: added Monitor Cast app to default list
[/whatsnew]
[files]
de/gui.lua
usr/bin/monitor-cast.lua
etc/apps.conf
installer.lua
latest_update.upd
[/files]
